    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28934" root="عز" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْزُوزَةٌ</span></b> , applied to land, or ground, (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ</span>, S, O,)
<i>Hard,</i> or <i>firm;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَدِيدَةٌ</span>. (S, O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
And, so applied, <i>Rained upon</i> (O, K, TA) <i>by
rain such as is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِزّ</span>, <i>and rendered compact,</i>
or <i>coherent, and hard;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَزَازَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَزَّآءُ</span></b> .
(TA.)

